{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kinetic is a first-person platform game with smooth and responsive movements. It's all about optimizing trajectories, using momentum and portals to complete each level as quickly as possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dimensions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You move through three different environments:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>concrete dimension</strong>, with its standard first-person parkour moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/3ba8e81d9e6d788b15e83209853df5ef.poster.avif?t=1772144657\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/3ba8e81d9e6d788b15e83209853df5ef.webm?t=1772144657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/3ba8e81d9e6d788b15e83209853df5ef.mp4?t=1772144657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>ice dimension</strong>, which lets you glide at speed, much like you would on a skating rink. This dimension is inspired by Counter Strike's surf mode and Urban Terror's icy mode but is beginners friendly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/a8e3e44bf4a96369afc0073999ad2b5c.poster.avif?t=1772144657\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/a8e3e44bf4a96369afc0073999ad2b5c.webm?t=1772144657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>bounce dimension</strong>, which lets you bounce on any surface without losing momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/686ee5b8caf1a19814937734ab54fbf8.poster.avif?t=1772144657\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/686ee5b8caf1a19814937734ab54fbf8.webm?t=1772144657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've unlocked the dimensions, you'll be free to switch from one to the other whenever you like using the portal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has its own leaderboard, which stores the best times of all players. It also has a \u201cfriends\u201d section so you can compare yourself only with them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/b52665a0abcde745521b413b10fb1401.avif?t=1772144657\" width=264 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, there is a global leaderboard that groups together all the times for all levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Traces / Trajectories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a level, you can see other players trace by checking the box next to any player leaderboard entry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/79d488b95891bb62252a56cb4c92a920.avif?t=1772144657\" width=1280 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, share and play community maps with the integrated level editor and Steam workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/2536f26cff20b002e57c34537fb6de7d.avif?t=1772144657\" width=1282 height=752 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Magenta gems","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383350/3578ef4ffa478c99b2987090e6905e653b62b5e8.jpg"},{"name":"A rank","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383350/f052f3e968ff39822488470d8ddb029c150364db.jpg"},{"name":"S rank","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383350/9ef85b12cc2a8471c6166fa93a74e019defc084a.jpg"},{"name":"Restaaaaart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383350/3a852de6f8d34d657abb44597cd8b48b83f0e4c9.jpg"},{"name":"Finisher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383350/c751076b065dddabd8e5364658973c2b9bdd9090.jpg"},{"name":"Try harder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383350/46a17f56a635af1e60ddd13d2be219aa04e17722.jpg"},{"name":"A+ rank","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383350/33fc479fb1f62b8ff04b46c0bfba271f23e06ad0.jpg"},{"name":"S+ rank","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383350/06ae572da6f4a92aa535db49c4767d15f353b1d5.jpg"},{"name":"A++ rank","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383350/f8653d8d48746cf1128abbfabff50b7657968f22.jpg"},{"name":"S++ rank","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383350/9045614def35f533a53f4a7b5fc2d03a7d6b68df.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3383350?t=1772144657","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3383350?t=1772144657","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/d4b8d60daed607f653102a055fcab3d5bd7a3308/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772144657","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/d4b8d60daed607f653102a055fcab3d5bd7a3308/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772144657","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kinetic is a first-person platform game with smooth and responsive movements. It's all about optimizing trajectories, using momentum and portals to complete each level as quickly as possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dimensions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You move through three different environments:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>concrete dimension</strong>, with its standard first-person parkour moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/3ba8e81d9e6d788b15e83209853df5ef.poster.avif?t=1772144657\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/3ba8e81d9e6d788b15e83209853df5ef.webm?t=1772144657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/3ba8e81d9e6d788b15e83209853df5ef.mp4?t=1772144657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>ice dimension</strong>, which lets you glide at speed, much like you would on a skating rink. This dimension is inspired by Counter Strike's surf mode and Urban Terror's icy mode but is beginners friendly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/a8e3e44bf4a96369afc0073999ad2b5c.poster.avif?t=1772144657\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/a8e3e44bf4a96369afc0073999ad2b5c.webm?t=1772144657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>bounce dimension</strong>, which lets you bounce on any surface without losing momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/686ee5b8caf1a19814937734ab54fbf8.poster.avif?t=1772144657\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/686ee5b8caf1a19814937734ab54fbf8.webm?t=1772144657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've unlocked the dimensions, you'll be free to switch from one to the other whenever you like using the portal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has its own leaderboard, which stores the best times of all players. It also has a \u201cfriends\u201d section so you can compare yourself only with them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/b52665a0abcde745521b413b10fb1401.avif?t=1772144657\" width=264 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, there is a global leaderboard that groups together all the times for all levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Traces / Trajectories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a level, you can see other players trace by checking the box next to any player leaderboard entry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/79d488b95891bb62252a56cb4c92a920.avif?t=1772144657\" width=1280 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, share and play community maps with the integrated level editor and Steam workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/extras/2536f26cff20b002e57c34537fb6de7d.avif?t=1772144657\" width=1282 height=752 /></span></p>","developers":["Lowraiz Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383350/c7a0ba465d9018773683d68afb13894bc58a39e0/header.jpg?t=1772144657","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB VRAM, Vulkan support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3 GHz<br></li><li><stro